  data: {
    LLM: 'Reach a cumulative score of +11 or more, or -11 or less, over multiple hands. Each hand, score +1 per trick over your quota of 4, -1 per trick under 4; exactly 4 tricks scores 0.\n\nClubs are always trumps. Follow suit if possible; if possible you must play a card that beats the highest card so far in the trick. You may not lead a club until clubs are broken or you have only clubs. Trick won by highest club in it, or if no club by highest card of the suit led. Winner of each trick leads to the next.',
    Player: 'Reach a cumulative score of +11 or more, or -11 or less, over multiple hands. Each hand, score +1 per trick over your quota of 4, -1 per trick under 4; exactly 4 tricks scores 0.\n\nClubs are always trumps. Follow suit if possible; if possible you must play a card that beats the highest card so far in the trick. You may not lead a club until clubs are broken or you have only clubs. Trick won by highest club in it, or if no club by highest card of the suit led. Winner of each trick leads to the next.',
